{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29525","headline":"灯 · 李商隐","name":"灯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎洁终无倦，煎熬亦自求。\n花时随酒远，雨後背窗休。\n冷暗黄茅驿，暄明紫桂楼。\n锦囊名画揜，玉局败碁收。\n何处无佳梦，谁人不隐忧。\n影随帘押转，光信簟文流。\n客自胜潘岳，侬今定莫愁。\n固应留半焰，廻照下帏羞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}